WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.123
A useful engineering model starts with needs and ends with evidence.

2
00:00:04.123 --> 00:00:07.336
Members and project communities surface requirements.

3
00:00:07.336 --> 00:00:10.489
The Steering Committee aligns programme and funding.

4
00:00:10.489 --> 00:00:13.035
The TAC coordinates roadmaps and policies.

5
00:00:13.035 --> 00:00:18.249
Project communities design, review, verify, document, and maintain the implementation.

6
00:00:18.249 --> 00:00:22.069
Users inspect repositories, tests, manuals, tags, and releases.

7
00:00:22.069 --> 00:00:25.343
This is a conceptual loop, not a mandatory stage-gate.

8
00:00:25.343 --> 00:00:30.375
It preserves the boundary between working-group coordination and project decisions.

